 "template": "combat.lock_on",
 "about": "On the plaza with traffic and people set to none. Two people stand ahead, 12 and 18 m off: lock_target takes the nearer. A hostile person (unarmed) comes at the player from 22 m: lock_target takes it over the nearer one, the camera keeps it in the middle of the view and the aim point on its Chest while it runs in, and the pistol stops it. Then single rounds with lock-on at people standing 15 m away, one each: ten from the pistol, ten from the rifle, ten from the SMG, after a world reset. People near a gunshot run from it (TR-13).",
